B.aV1=new A.cm(null,"Movie Suggester AI","Movie Suggester AI is an intelligent chat-based application that provides personalized movie and TV show recommendations. Users engage in natural conversations with an AI assistant that analyzes their preferences, mood, and interests to suggest the perfect content to watch. The app features a modern, responsive interface with real-time streaming responses, comprehensive movie details from IMDB integration, and support for multiple content types including movies, series, and general entertainment guidance.","assets/images/movie_suggester.jpeg",B.aNf,null,null,"https://movie-suggester-ai.netlify.app/","AI/ML",0,!0)
