B.aV8=new A.cm(null,"Woof \u2013 Pet Safety","Woof is the #1 app for Pet Parents' peace of mind \u2013 designed to rescue your pet if something unexpectedly happens to you (eg car accident, heart attack, etc.).The Woof app was created by pet parents whose biggest fear is their pet being stranded alone at home for days (or worse) with no one to care for them if an unexpected tragedy occurred.","assets/images/image_woof.webp",B.axV,"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/woof-pet-safety/id1613059890",null,null,"Flutter",0,!0)
